sh: no double quote in a comment of memset.S

GCC 2.95's preprocessor does not know that "!" starts an SH assembler
comment: the quote in J"orn starts a string that never ends ("unterminated
string or character constant") and memset.S does not assemble.

--- a/newlib-1.16.0/newlib/libc/machine/sh/memset.S
+++ b/newlib-1.16.0/newlib/libc/machine/sh/memset.S
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
